    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "Can it charge other smartwatches?",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>No, the RORRY Portable Charger for Apple Watch is specifically designed for Apple Watch models only. It uses Apple's proprietary magnetic charging technology and will not charge other smartwatch brands like Samsung Galaxy Watch, Garmin, Fitbit, or other non-Apple smartwatches. Each smartwatch brand typically uses different charging standards and connectors, so this charger is exclusive to Apple Watch compatibility.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_k4TaYX": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "Is this charger easy to carry?",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes,the RORRY Portable Charger is incredibly portable and easy to carry. The built-in keychain makes it super convenient - you can clip it to your keys, backpack, or purse. </p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_7cU3w4": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "How secure is the magnetic connection?",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Equipped with the latest N54 magnets (2024), it delivers a strong 200g magnetic grip to hold your watch securely. The precision-designed surface ensures perfect alignment every time.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_qwLt6A": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "How fast can it charge my Apple Watch?",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>With 3.5W wireless fast charging, a full charge takes just 56 minutes (based on Series 9), which is 2× faster than standard chargers. The USB-C cable provides a 5W emergency boost for AirPods or iPhone 15/16/17.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_ktk8BM": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "Does it have overcharge protection?",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes,the RORRY Portable Charger includes comprehensive safety features including overcharge protection to prevent damage to your device's battery. The charger also features LED indicator lights that display the remaining power level, helping you monitor the charging status and avoid overcharging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
